<h2>~[IPriest.1]~[IPriest.1]~[IPriest.1]~[IPriest.1]~[IPriest.1]Clones~[IPriest.1]~[IPriest.1]~[IPriest.1]~[IPriest.1]~[IPriest.1]</h2>
<i>Guldan: ~.Ummm...They enemy seemed to have cloned you.  It was probably that energy you felt eariler.</i><br>
<i>You: ~.What the hell I'm I suppose to do about these?  It is 5 on 2, and my ally doesn't have an island for himself!<br>
<i>Guldan: ~.Relax, you have some advantages in this war.  First you have a great and complexe defense.  Take a look at that baby, ability to take any hit.  Of course, I gave you some of my Technology plans, and some how got a sum of 10000 for you to start with.  You also have us crossing our fingers.<br>
<i>You: ~.Can't you get some back up?<br>
<i>Guldan: ~.In time, my friend, in time...Good Luck<br>
Ok, it is seemly near impossible to win...What are you going to do?

